      "writtenOn": "2025-01-13T20:21:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unit test run in the same package and doesn\u0027t need to be public.\nThis method could be private for the main usage, and for test purposes it need to be package-private, we should add @VisibleForTesting then:\n\n\nWe can probably do the same for others method like setGroupVolume (and more ?)\n\n```suggestion\n    @VisibleForTesting\n    void setDeviceVolume(BluetoothDevice device, int volume, boolean isGroupOp) {\n```",
      "parentUuid": "e6abc7f3_a6a5572f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 536,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 536,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "82b01636d0bd5154613d72f56ae2b93a3262f430",
