      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-14T08:01:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for explenation! Does it means that all variables which are synchronized, should have such @GuardedBy? I.e. in BassClientService.java there are a lot of variable synchronizations (added by me too) but almost not @GuardedBy,  should they be added?\n\n`synchronized (mDeviceVolumeCache)` is not valid anymore as aosp/3422359 change it to method synchronization, at least before you rebase/merge your changes.",
      "parentUuid": "2b095e69_f36cc63f",
      "range": {
